      "code": "pimasize = sizeof (IMA_ADPCM_PRIVATE) + blockalign * psf->sf.channels + 3 * psf->sf.channels * samplesperblock ;",
      "role": "intermediate",
      "note": "Allocation scales the sample area from samplesperblock and the block area from blockalign, without accounting for the decoder writing an eight-sample group for any remaining compressed byte."
    },
    {
